      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-10-17T22:22:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Not that this is helpful but SotM is not the only app having this issue with In App Purchases(IAP). &nbsp; &nbsp;The main way they seem to reproduce it is when they try to download an IAP and don't have the space for it. &nbsp; After that even if you do clear enough space you still will get the error. &nbsp; It's an issue Apple is looking into further as it has even affected apps that haven't been modified in years and more recent ones. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:28:10.459Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
