      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Not that this is helpful but SotM is not the only app having this issue with In App Purchases(IAP). &nbsp; &nbsp;The main way they seem to reproduce it is when they try to download an IAP and don&#39;t have the space for it. &nbsp; After that even if you do clear enough space you still will get the error. &nbsp; It&#39;s an issue Apple is looking into further as it has even affected apps that haven&#39;t been modified in years and more recent ones. &nbsp;</p>",
