      "created_at": "2015-10-17T22:34:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Please get in touch with us via feedback@handelabra.com and we will let you know whenever we hear more from Apple. It's a bug in iOS itself that affects any app that uses Apple hosted IAP downloads. Apple is working on it and we hope it'll be fixed in an iOS update soon.</p>",
