      "raw": "[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n\nPlease get in touch with us via <a href=\"mailto:feedback@handelabra.com\">feedback@handelabra.com</a> and we will let you know whenever we hear more from Apple. It&#39;s a bug in iOS itself that affects any app that uses Apple hosted IAP downloads. Apple is working on it and we hope it&#39;ll be fixed in an iOS update soon.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThanks. Email on way. &nbsp;Guess I&#39;ll be seeking refund if no imminent fix.\n\nFYI (and for others info) in my case a complete reset (painful as it was ) did not solve the problem.\n\n#Powerhound, thanks again for comments. &nbsp;Have to say that this is first IAP that I&#39;ve had this problem with, but then again it may have been sometime since my last one... Perhaps 4 months?\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n",
